# Demonstração da suíte em demo.minhasuite.com: a vitrine Rails (componentes ao vivo, gem desta árvore)
# na raiz, a vitrine Flutter compilada para web em /app/ e o APK em /componentes-demo.apk.
# O Flutter web e o APK chegam prontos em demo/out/ (o workflow demo.yml compila antes do docker build).
FROM docker.io/library/ruby:3.3-slim
RUN apt-get update -qq && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends build-essential curl git libyaml-dev \
    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
ENV RAILS_ENV=production BUNDLE_WITHOUT="development:test" RAILS_LOG_TO_STDOUT=1 RAILS_SERVE_STATIC_FILES=1
WORKDIR /w
COPY rails/ /w/rails/
COPY paletas/ /w/paletas/
WORKDIR /w/rails/sample
RUN bundle install --jobs 4 && SECRET_KEY_BASE_DUMMY=1 bin/rails tailwindcss:build assets:precompile
COPY demo/out/app/ /w/rails/sample/public/app/
COPY demo/out/componentes-demo.apk /w/rails/sample/public/componentes-demo.apk
ARG GIT_SHA=dev
ENV GIT_SHA=$GIT_SHA
EXPOSE 3000
CMD ["bin/rails", "server", "-b", "0.0.0.0", "-p", "3000"]
